{"event_type":"review","id":"81e27f2da695246f4f901ef5540caea2a3dbdf118cb8e75d750117579b12f856","occurred_at":"2026-11-08T14:39:45Z","payload":{"artifacts":[{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/228159a8d55538836cfa1f36bfb0243ac270e4cd59f6c50b6eac99761be5c223","sha256":"228159a8d55538836cfa1f36bfb0243ac270e4cd59f6c50b6eac99761be5c223"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/e37cdbf65204140ee67219abca1131c006ed9513829f8684d4ed09d168608657","sha256":"e37cdbf65204140ee67219abca1131c006ed9513829f8684d4ed09d168608657"},{"kind":"git-bundle","location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/251d5fedfd93e83bbc4aee2dc84c687af8a01a453d7abe4c505ff7bae05d43d5","sha256":"251d5fedfd93e83bbc4aee2dc84c687af8a01a453d7abe4c505ff7bae05d43d5"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/8090a0e030b69045d64633f4022353d37f9bdc4db415843a7b9f4dc5ff4a264f","sha256":"8090a0e030b69045d64633f4022353d37f9bdc4db415843a7b9f4dc5ff4a264f"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/7b6a87c3ce67cf143f41b08430cc74809d6c9644ff3fe8e31e05345e49e72577","sha256":"7b6a87c3ce67cf143f41b08430cc74809d6c9644ff3fe8e31e05345e49e72577"}],"attempt_id":"ba8f864d530c9485a60b8ffc90456a1445abbcfd923297f1bbdf2117fd3c3bc5:0:1","base":"1a430da857797944d6cc099700d5aa32c4ec1060","completion":{"errors":[],"exit_code":0,"scope_verified":true,"skipped":false,"terminal":true},"findings":[{"anchor_status":"unverified","blob":"47c38fe6543030c9217e780469ba00c5eb477334","body":"**Skip units that already have collected evidence before adding a \"never started\" row.**\n\n`src/ops/fix/runFix.ts:1030` adds an `unstartedUnits` entry for any unit whose runner result is not `ok` and that is not already in the list. The runner's governance can replace a job result after the unit returned `ok`. Line 486 says so: \"Sum landed invocation evidence even when governance replaces a job result\". In that case `collected` holds the unit's report, `row.report` is set, and `report.tasks` (L1020-1023) already includes that unit's real task rows.\n\nTrigger: a unit returns `ok` with tasks, and the governor then marks the job `budget-exhausted`.\n\nWhat happens:\n- `accountPlanned()` emits the real task rows plus a `neverStartedRow` for the same unit.\n- `counters.planned` and `counters.unresolved` each go up by one.\n- `report.failed` gains a branchless \"unit halted on a budget bound\" row.\n- In PR mode, the uploaded \"Unfixed\" section (L1114-1130) lists the unit as not started, even though it ran and has evidence.\n\nThe cancel path at L1204 is not affected, because this loop has already marked the unit as known.\n\n<details>\n<summary>Proposed fix</summary>\n\n```diff\n-        if (row.result.status !== 'ok' && !known) {\n+        if (row.result.status !== 'ok' && row.report === undefined && !known) {\n```\n</details>","id":"d951ba1859ee94716a5a356ebee080f0c87d5434796feab234306cb6141c1619","intervals":[],"path":"src/ops/fix/runFix.ts","severity":"minor","source_id":null,"status":"untriaged","title":"Skip units that already have collected evidence before adding a \"never started\" row."}],"head":"deb4628016c42d19fce096aeb505a5a25425c8e9","head_tree":"f3d13794b479ccd72ccb765c7289aa9698c4c59f","input_scope":[{"blob":"47c38fe6543030c9217e780469ba00c5eb477334","intervals":[[8,9],[11,32],[52,52],[57,57],[63,63],[65,77],[81,87],[94,109],[113,120],[132,323],[337,337],[344,354],[361,403],[405,442],[450,485],[498,506],[528,619],[621,621],[639,640],[665,665],[706,713],[739,750],[760,760],[771,771],[799,858],[871,873],[909,927],[959,999],[1006,1013],[1024,1052],[1065,1069],[1080,1158],[1184,1218],[1225,1225],[1236,1237],[1241,1257]],"path":"src/ops/fix/runFix.ts"}],"job_id":"ba8f864d530c9485a60b8ffc90456a1445abbcfd923297f1bbdf2117fd3c3bc5:0","outcome":"completed","paths":[{"baseline":{"entry":{"blob":"defd21b27682a84f6c13cf784d08db1f1a57a818","kind":"blob","mode":"100644","path":"src/op